(7677406, 1254877, 100831, '<td valign="top">If you feed me, Seymour, I can grow up big and strong!  Good one... brings great memories.</td>', 'If you feed me, Seymour, I can grow up big and strong!  Good one... brings great memories.', '2020-10-21 15:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677407, 1255266, 100831, '<td valign="top">Good catch! Nicely done.</td>', 'Good catch! Nicely done.', '2020-10-21 15:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677422, 1254784, 114285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light as usual, already voted.</td>', 'Beautiful light as usual, already voted.', '2020-10-21 21:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677427, 1255280, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific feel of bygone days.  Formal yet casual.  The color palette is excellent.  That cup is so important.</td>', 'Terrific feel of bygone days.  Formal yet casual.  The color palette is excellent.  That cup is so important.', '2020-10-21 21:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677428, 1255223, 173844, '<td valign="top">An unusual stretching of traditional photography, being a creation wholly made within the software landscape.  And it''s lovely, buttery and heartfelt.  Something special.</td>', 'An unusual stretching of traditional photography, being a creation wholly made within the software landscape.  And it''s lovely, buttery and heartfelt.  Something special.', '2020-10-21 21:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677429, 1255177, 173844, '<td valign="top">This moody image, centered on the rounded hill, immediately pulls you into the realm of magic.  I like the overall dark exposure.  The hilltop manages to be dark and sunlit at the same time, subtly establishing the mood.  It''s pregnant with adventure.</td>', 'This moody image, centered on the rounded hill, immediately pulls you into the realm of magic.  I like the overall dark exposure.  The hilltop manages to be dark and sunlit at the same time, subtly establishing the mood.  It''s pregnant with adventure.', '2020-10-21 21:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677430, 1255266, 173844, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary image, so intent is the bird, and so doomed is the fish.  The sharpness and colors reach out and tear away the film separating the viewer''s comfort of distance from the immediacy of actual experience.  Momentous.</td>', 'Extraordinary image, so intent is the bird, and so doomed is the fish.  The sharpness and colors reach out and tear away the film separating the viewer''s comfort of distance from the immediacy of actual experience.  Momentous.', '2020-10-21 21:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677431, 1255201, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely, delicate fantasy, kind of Klimpt-ish.  When I try to look at the individual elements I realise that I prefer to sink into the beckoning totality.  Is the person coming or going?  Nice ambiguity there.</td>', 'Lovely, delicate fantasy, kind of Klimpt-ish.  When I try to look at the individual elements I realise that I prefer to sink into the beckoning totality.  Is the person coming or going?  Nice ambiguity there.', '2020-10-21 21:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677432, 1255292, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good title for this synaptic symphony.  It''s complexity calls out the wonder of life.  The colors feel just right.</td>', 'Good title for this synaptic symphony.  It''s complexity calls out the wonder of life.  The colors feel just right.', '2020-10-21 21:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677433, 1255245, 173844, '<td valign="top">And minty fresh.  The rhythm, the to and fro, brings the viewer to sway along, refreshed and serene.  Very nice.</td>', 'And minty fresh.  The rhythm, the to and fro, brings the viewer to sway along, refreshed and serene.  Very nice.', '2020-10-21 22:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677434, 1255270, 173844, '<td valign="top">Okay, get it, and I''m sighing too.  Nicely seen and composed.  Would have made a splash in Abstract in Color.  Fresh paint might wreck the image, but it can be worth it.  Impressive.</td>', 'Okay, get it, and I''m sighing too.  Nicely seen and composed.  Would have made a splash in Abstract in Color.  Fresh paint might wreck the image, but it can be worth it.  Impressive.', '2020-10-21 22:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677435, 1255281, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  Are those aspens, or birches, really that tall and bare-trunked?  Of course it''s the caught light that makes the scene glow.  Looks like a local golden rainbow.  Must be wonderful to be there.</td>', 'Lovely image.  Are those aspens, or birches, really that tall and bare-trunked?  Of course it''s the caught light that makes the scene glow.  Looks like a local golden rainbow.  Must be wonderful to be there.', '2020-10-21 22:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677436, 1255289, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome still life.  I really like that it''s not fussy and precious, and hence much more endearing.  The pear on the left is a marvel, soft, glowing and fading into the shadows.  Nice composition and palette.</td>', 'Handsome still life.  I really like that it''s not fussy and precious, and hence much more endearing.  The pear on the left is a marvel, soft, glowing and fading into the shadows.  Nice composition and palette.', '2020-10-21 22:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677441, 1254938, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is really lovely. I just wish that the horse in front were larger than the other two.</td>', 'This is really lovely. I just wish that the horse in front were larger than the other two.', '2020-10-21 23:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7677442, 1255077, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice bit of artistic whimsy.</td>', 'Nice bit of artistic whimsy.', '2020-10-21 23:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
